  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In recent years, tourism has developed quickly in Western China. This "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " has led to a huge increase in trash, with most of it left behind by tourists. In 2021, photos showing piles of plastic waste along the Qinghai-Xizang Highway were "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " shared online. These "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " made many people worried about the local environment and the "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "impact",
      "ref": "v-impact"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of tourism."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Local governments and "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "nonprofits",
      "ref": "v-nonprofit"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " have "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " many different ways to deal with this problem. One creative project uses a(n) "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " idea: trash for toilet use. The project "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b6",
      "number": 6
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " special restrooms in popular "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "scenic areas",
      "zh": "景区"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". For example, there is one such restroom on "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Mount Zheduo",
      "zh": "折多山"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". To use it, visitors must first "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b7",
      "number": 7
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " an empty plastic bottle into an "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "intelligent",
      "ref": "v-intelligent"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " box. The box will then give them a “green coin”. They can use this green coin to "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b8",
      "number": 8
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " the restroom door."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Green River, an environmental organization, is "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b9",
      "number": 9
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " the project. “Tens of thousands of visitors "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b10",
      "number": 10
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " his project,” the nonprofit said in a post on Weibo. “Millions of pieces of trash have been "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b11",
      "number": 11
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " through this method.”"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "For some visitors, however, the project can be "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b12",
      "number": 12
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". One visitor shared his "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b13",
      "number": 13
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " on social media. “It’s a good and environmental idea,” he said. “But it’s "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b14",
      "number": 14
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for visitors to always have an empty bottle on hand when they need to use the restroom.” This might be a "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b15",
      "number": 15
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". What do you think of this project?"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
